<h1>info<span class="cursor"></span></h1>
<div class="manual">
<p class="lead">The user manual of the lab. <code>llb lab</code> runs the same commands as the <code>llb</code> CLI on the same files, so everything here also works from a terminal, and the other way round.</p>

